  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h1 style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;font-family:'Fearlessly Authentic DEMO';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:36px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;color:rgb(140,23,37);width:100%;max-width:900px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">Kova Cold Brew Coffee Concentrate</h1><p style=\"padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;width:638.875px;max-width:100%;text-align:left;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin:5px 0px;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><br><strong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;\">Strong. Simple. Smooth. Coffee that fits your lifestyle.</strong></p><p style=\"padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;width:638.875px;max-width:100%;text-align:left;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;color:rgb(93,93,93);margin:5px 0px;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">Pure Arabica beans and slow-brew in KOVA coffee is an irresistible combination of taste and aroma that keeps your day moving with steady energy. It fits effortlessly into your day - your soft morning lift or a bold, expressive brew. You’ll get a smooth, refined cup every time.</p><ul style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 30px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;max-width:427px;text-align:left;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.81);font-family:Manrope;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:disc;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);width:224.325px;max-width:100%;\"><strong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;\">1 tsp: </strong>light, clean lift</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:disc;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);width:224.325px;max-width:100%;\"><strong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;\">2 tsp:</strong>  bold, full-bodied flavour</li><li><p style=\"margin:20px 0px 0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><strong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;\">Here’s what makes KOVA special:</strong></p><ul style=\"margin-top:20px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.81);font-family:Manrope;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><li style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;position:relative;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Smooth and clean texture - never bitter</li><li style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;position:relative;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Stable, consistent energy with no crash</li><li style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;position:relative;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Every pour has consistent flavour</li><li style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;position:relative;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Ready in seconds - hot, iced, blended, or over milk<br><br><br></li><li><h1 style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;list-style:none;font-family:'Fearlessly Authentic DEMO';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:36px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;color:rgb(140,23,37);width:100%;max-width:900px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><br></h1></li></ul></li></ul></div>",
